  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting State Party for the protection of the World Heritage in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uzbekistan possesses important build heritage that need efficient protection. This activity is crucial to fill the gaps to preserve the Uzbekistan&#x2019;s Worlds Heritage properties. Within the activity, an international expertise will be provided to build the capacity of national stakeholders for planning, estimating and  costing of conservation projects at World heritage sites, enhancing their ability to document, develop, manage, monitor, and execute conservation and restoration projects effectively.</narrative>
